# Stock Predictor Configuration
# 
# For yfinance (default): No API key required
# This file is provided for reference if you want to use alternative APIs

# Alpha Vantage API (optional - for advanced features)
# Get your free API key from: https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
# ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Finnhub API (optional)
# Get your free API key from: https://finnhub.io/
# FINNHUB_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Note: The default stock_predictor.py uses yfinance which doesn't require
# any API keys. Only configure these if you're using alternative services.
